            "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:32:13.238846+00:00",
            "notes": "-[Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) is a great power to start with, as it will be essential to your build for the whole game. \n\n-[Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) is great in the early game, as it allows for easier kills/snipes which are very important for earning stadium cash before we can get more ability power.\n\n(optional) -If you are using dynamite to apply burn, choose [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739)\n \n(optional) -[Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491) can also be chosen on round one, because it will be very effective at earning lots of stadium cash in the early rounds. It will mean that you only set up the actual build later into the game- so only select this power if you are very confident in your shots. note- I am still testing the effectiveness of choosing this power for the first round, comment if you find success using it.)",
