            "notes": "-Now that you have more cash and can apply burning more effectively, you should get the [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) power. We can now start farming ult and ability power!\n\n-If they have a kiri, [Furnace Fuel](item_aac67acc-e7d0-4465-b3d3-1276a6de0f86) is essential!!\n\n-If you chose [Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491) for the first round, choose [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) for this round- and continue selecting the previous recommended powers. (so you wont be able to get the recommended round 9 power) \n\n(optional) -If you chose [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) as your power for the first round, you can choose [Molten Munitions](item_a784dd14-8d4d-4f3b-81f4-371c9979593e) to better apply burn with dynamite.\n\n(optional) -if you are using dynamite to apply burn, [Stacked Sticks](item_2ad5dace-ac3c-43fe-b20b-3add489a7207) is essential.",
