            "created_at": "2025-09-13T00:32:13.238846+00:00",
            "notes": "-Choose [Double Barreled](item_962b847f-140d-41a4-9bac-ddcdb088951e) in order to proc [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) as much as possible. Try to always keep one use available so you cant get as easily killed. \n\n-[Calamity](item_d6cdfbfe-61f4-4aa2-979f-f7793000b15c) is also a great pick for if you arent using your coach gun as often as youd like, or if you are having trouble being able to proc burn without dying. \n\n-I highly recommend to keep scaling your ability power as much as you can, before you get more targeted perks.\n\n(optional) -if you are losing or have extra cash, then you should highly consider getting perks that have extra effects like [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).",
